# Function-valued scope fields retain their captured input.

```catala
declaration scope FunctionProvider:
  input offset content integer
  output predicate content boolean depends on value content integer

scope FunctionProvider:
  definition predicate of value equals if value > offset then true else false

declaration scope FunctionRecord:
  input x content integer
  output result content boolean

scope FunctionRecord:
  definition result equals
    ((output of FunctionProvider with { -- offset: x }).predicate of (x + 1))
    and not ((output of FunctionProvider with { -- offset: x }).predicate of (x - 1))
```
